{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014NpjMGXRL6giWG4mFxRZ9Z","type":"tool_result","content":"760\t  }\n761\t}\n762\t\n763\t/* ============================================================\n764\t   Styled Native Select with appearance: base-select (US-188)\n765\t   Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+, Firefox future.\n766\t   @supports fallback for browsers without appearance: base-select.\n767\t   Retains built-in accessibility (keyboard, screen reader).\n768\t   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/a-customizable-select\n769\t   ============================================================ */\n770\t@supports (appearance: base-select) {\n771\t  select.select-base {\n772\t    appearance: base-select;\n773\t    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n774\t    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n775\t    background-color: var(--color-stone-50, #fafaf9);\n776\t    color: var(--color-stone-900, #1c1917);\n777\t    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n778\t    font-size: 0.875rem;\n779\t    line-height: 1.5;\n780\t    font-family: inherit;\n781\t    cursor: pointer;\n782\t    transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, background-color 0.2s ease-out;\n783\t  }\n784\t\n785\t  select.select-base:hover {\n786\t    border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n787\t  }\n788\t\n789\t  select.select-base:focus-visible {\n790\t    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n791\t    outline-offset: 2px;\n792\t  }\n793\t\n794\t  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n795\t    select.select-base {\n796\t      background-color: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n797\t      color: var(--color-stone-100, #f5f5f4);\n798\t      border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n799\t    }\n800\t\n801\t    select.select-base:hover {\n802\t      border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n803\t    }\n804\t\n805\t    select.select-base:focus-visible {\n806\t      outline-color: var(--color-amber-400, #fbbf24);\n807\t    }\n808\t  }\n809\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e214bee3-232f-4b1b-8118-dc441d3da087","uuid":"bc40732b-cb32-4935-ade6-4f3a983a688b","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:51:48.624Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","content":"  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Styled Native Select with appearance: base-select (US-188)\n   Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+, Firefox future.\n   @supports fallback for browsers without appearance: base-select.\n   Retains built-in accessibility (keyboard, screen reader).\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/a-customizable-select\n   ============================================================ */\n@supports (appearance: base-select) {\n  select.select-base {\n    appearance: base-select;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n    background-color: var(--color-stone-50, #fafaf9);\n    color: var(--color-stone-900, #1c1917);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, background-color 0.2s ease-out;\n  }\n\n  select.select-base:hover {\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n  }\n\n  select.select-base:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    select.select-base {\n      background-color: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n      color: var(--color-stone-100, #f5f5f4);\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n    }\n\n    select.select-base:hover {\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n    }\n\n    select.select-base:focus-visible {\n      outline-color: var(--color-amber-400, #fbbf24);\n    }\n  }\n","numLines":50,"startLine":760,"totalLines":895}}}
